    "alpha_137_double": "137 = q^q*(mu+1) + lam appears as BOTH alpha_em^{-1}(0) (CCLVI Suzuki) AND the charm Yukawa denominator (CCCXXIX), with all light-quark Yukawas in the 137^n hierarchy.",
    "mu_4_PMNS_pattern": "mu = 4 is the SHARED numerator of sin^2 theta_12 = mu/Phi_3 and sin^2 theta_23 = mu/Phi_6, giving the scale-free ratio Phi_6/Phi_3 = 7/13.",
    "Phi_4_recurrence": "Phi_4 = 10 appears in lambda_H denominator (CCCXXIV), CKM A denominator (CCCXXV), y_s numerator (CCCXXX), sin^2 theta_13 denominator (CCCXXXVI) -- 4 closures.",
    "v_plus_1_double": "v+1 = 41 appears as BOTH the y_t^3 denominator (CCCXXVI) AND the SM b_1 numerator b_1^SM = (v+1)/Phi_4 = 41/10 (CCCXXIII), tying gauge running to top Yukawa structure through one W(3,3) integer."
